{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-common-biology-12","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":12,"points":null,"unitId":"cell","unitLabel":"세포 구조·세포주기·세포사멸","topic":"미세소관","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["cell","renal"],"stem":"세포가분열할때중요한역할을하는미세소관(microtubule)은\n튜블린(tubulin) 분자의결합으로구성된빈실린더모양의구조를\n하고있다. 그림은세포에서분리한튜블린분자가시간이경과함에\n따라시험관에서미세소관을형성하는과정을나타낸것이다.\n위의그림과관련된설명중옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 중심체(centrosome)를넣어주면(가) 곡선에서(나) 곡선\n으로바뀐다.\nㄴ. A는튜블린이중체(dimer)가서로결합하여미세소관의\n신장을준비하는단계이다.\nㄷ. B는튜블린이중체가미세소관에붙는속도가떨어지는\n속도보다빠른단계이다.\nㄹ. C는튜블린이중체가미세소관에붙고떨어지는반응이\n더이상일어나지않는단계이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":381,"height":291,"region":0,"bbox":[88.056,82.62,152.4,116.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-12/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":401,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,241.82,308.8,160.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-12/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":4,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.18,416.5,603.429],"width":333.756,"height":451.249,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[88.056,82.62,152.4,116.4],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,241.82,308.8,160.4],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"12. 세포가분열할때중요한역할을하는미세